#
# Local mkdocs scratch artifacts. The canonical build output lives at
# the repo-root `dist/help/` (gitignored alongside the rest of `dist/*`
# in the root `.gitignore`); these patterns guard against `mkdocs`
# leaving anything in the corpus dir itself.

# mkdocs intermediate caches and any in-tree builds (`mkdocs build`
# without `--site-dir` would default to `site/`; our config sets
# `site_dir: ../dist/help` so this is a belt-and-braces guard).
site/
.mkdocs-cache/

# Editor scratch.
.DS_Store
*.swp
